  "notes": [
    "Addresses are the Modbus offsets of the manual. Values are read with FC03 or FC04; settings are written with FC10 and commands with FC06.",
    "Read every value from its first register with its full length: a read that starts or ends inside a multi-register value returns an error.",
    "Factory settings: address 126, 19200 baud, 8N2.",
    "Not in this map: digital output, language and display settings (50033-50065) and the I&M data blocks."
